    kind: invariant  # 3731
    title: "A call classified into an OPAQUE boundary (subprocess/command_launch) counts as an EXAMINED negative for every other boundary, so a program that shells out to curl confirms both 'no fs_write' and 'no net_send'"  # 3731
    status: violated  # 3731
    priority: 0  # 3731
    parent:  # 3731
